 "sentences": [
  {
   "segment": "n42",
   "text": "But the first time a dark cloud gathered over the hills, imagine the fear.",
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 5.135,
   "line": 42,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n42",
   "text": "Would the water come back?",
   "start": 5.315,
   "end": 7.001,
   "line": 42,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n42",
   "text": "Every child who had heard the stories would look up and wonder.",
   "start": 7.181,
   "end": 11.149,
   "line": 42,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n43",
   "text": "And I will establish my covenant with you;",
   "start": 11.499,
   "end": 14.315,
   "kind": "scripture",
   "reference": "Genesis 9:11 (KJV)",
   "line": 43,
   "line_kind": "scripture"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n43",
   "text": "neither shall all flesh be cut off any more by the waters of a flood;",
   "start": 14.495,
   "end": 18.953,
   "kind": "scripture",
   "reference": "Genesis 9:11 (KJV)",
   "line": 43,
   "line_kind": "scripture"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n43",
   "text": "neither shall there any more be a flood to destroy the earth.",
   "start": 19.133,
   "end": 22.803,
   "kind": "scripture",
   "reference": "Genesis 9:11 (KJV)",
   "line": 43,
   "line_kind": "scripture"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n44",
   "text": "I do set my bow in the cloud, and it shall be for a token of a covenant between me and the earth.",
   "start": 23.153,
   "end": 29.425,
   "kind": "scripture",
   "reference": "Genesis 9:13 (KJV)",
   "line": 44,
   "line_kind": "scripture"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n45",
   "text": "And there it was, for the very first time:",
   "start": 29.775,
   "end": 32.505,
   "line": 45,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n45",
   "text": "a bow of colour, bending over the whole sky.",
   "start": 32.685,
   "end": 35.757,
   "line": 45,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n45",
   "text": "Not a weapon pointed at us.",
   "start": 35.937,
   "end": 38.007,
   "line": 45,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n45",
   "text": "A war bow, hung up.",
   "start": 38.187,
   "end": 39.787,
   "line": 45,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n46",
   "text": "And the bow shall be in the cloud;",
   "start": 40.137,
   "end": 42.206,
   "kind": "scripture",
   "reference": "Genesis 9:16 (KJV)",
   "line": 46,
   "line_kind": "scripture"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n46",
   "text": "and I will look upon it, that I may remember the everlasting covenant between God and every living creature of all flesh that is upon the earth.",
   "start": 42.386,
   "end": 52.093,
   "kind": "scripture",
   "reference": "Genesis 9:16 (KJV)",
   "line": 46,
   "line_kind": "scripture"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n47",
   "text": "Read that again.",
   "start": 52.443,
   "end": 53.851,
   "line": 47,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n47",
   "text": "The sign is not only for us to see.",
   "start": 54.031,
   "end": 56.847,
   "line": 47,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n47",
   "text": "God says He Himself will look upon it, and remember.",
   "start": 57.027,
   "end": 60.739,
   "line": 47,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n47",
   "text": "He holds the promise in His own hands.",
   "start": 60.919,
   "end": 63.585,
   "line": 47,
   "line_kind": "story"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n48",
   "text": "Notice what the rainbow is.",
   "start": 63.935,
   "end": 65.919,
   "line": 48,
   "line_kind": "insight"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n48",
   "text": "God hung up His own bow, pointing at the sky and not at us.",
   "start": 66.099,
   "end": 70.323,
   "line": 48,
   "line_kind": "insight"
  },
  {
   "segment": "n48",
   "text": "Mercy is His idea.",
   "start": 70.503,
   "end": 72.317,
   "line": 48,
   "line_kind": "insight"
  }
 ],
